+	 * SWEET: sweetfb_swaplog=N prints the first N swap records' layer mask
+	 * and per-layer surface ids, temporarily lifting the console mute so
+	 * the line is visible even with sweetfb_noconsole=1.  This separates
+	 * "backboardd never bound a valid surface" (mask 0 / ids 0) from "the
+	 * bound surface is black" (ids non-zero but no visible pixels).
+	 */
+	{
